  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Market Access Program &#x2013; trade capacity building</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Grant to support UNIDO&apos;s Global Market Access Programme (GMAP) in five to seven countries. The UNIDO global programme is set to enable new and accelerated access to international markets for small- and medium-scale enterprises (SMEs) in selected value-chains. The countries and specific sectors included are: Colombia &#x2013; Fish/shrimp; Ethiopia &#x2013; Honey; Mozambique &#x2013; Fish/shrimp; Nepal &#x2013; Honey; Somalia &#x2013; trade capacity building</narrative>
  </description>
